{% block extra %}
## Development

```sh
uv sync
uvx --with tox-uv tox
pre-commit install --hook-type pre-commit --hook-type pre-push
```

To run the server locally, keep its database and cache in the working directory:

```sh
PODPOCKET_PUBLIC_URL=http://localhost:8000 \
PODPOCKET_DATABASE_URL=sqlite+aiosqlite:///./dev.db \
PODPOCKET_CACHE_DIR=./cache \
PODPOCKET_SECRET_KEY=dev-only-dev-only-dev-only-dev-only \
uv run podpocket serve
```

Add `PODPOCKET_ALLOW_PRIVATE_FEEDS=true` to fetch feeds from your LAN or localhost.
